source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: An escaped leading `-` keeps a `-*` marker run a paragraph, so a `-` that starts a run is a list marker rather than a dash.
-- input.jira --
\-* item
-- rendered.html --
<p>&#45;* item</p>
-- want.md --
\-\* item
-- warnings.json --
[]
